The winning entries will be sent off to all of Madonna’s people along with the petition. <br><br>

You never know what will happen if they like them. Good luck! <br><br>



Email your designs along with your name, age and address to <a href="mailto:dmcompetition@yahoo.com">dmcompetition@yahoo.com</a>.

