  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P><STRONG>ANI&nbsp;&nbsp;- </STRONG><SPAN class=grtxt><FONT color=#555555>London</FONT></SPAN><SPAN class=grtxt><FONT color=#555555>,&nbsp;</FONT></SPAN><SPAN class=grtxt><FONT color=#555555>June 17, 2005</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P><STRONG>Most teenagers today are clueless of science</STRONG> and cannot name a single living scientist, <STRONG>believing that Madonna </STRONG>and Chemical Ali are the names of <STRONG>contemporary scientists, according to a recent survey.</STRONG></P>
<P>"The results go to show the growing apathy in today's students about science and their ignorance of modern-day achievements," Scotsman quoted Clara Kenyon, OCR's director of general assessment as saying.</P>
</font></div>
