	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P>Fans are&nbsp;asking about the musical <STRONG>"Hello Suckers</STRONG>" to which <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> herself declared to be attached to.</P>
<P>The movie based&nbsp;on the life of <STRONG>Texas Guinan</STRONG> originally casted <STRONG>Courtney Love</STRONG> as leading role.Love was offered the part in <STRONG>2001.</STRONG></P>
<P>After more then one year of waiting and speculation, <STRONG>IMDB </STRONG>( The Internet Movie Database) <STRONG>deleted Madonna's name</STRONG> as Texas and <STRONG>restored the&nbsp;name of Courtney Love</STRONG> in the movie's card.</P>
<P><U>This is <STRONG>no way an official confirmation</STRONG></U> as IMDB, uses to <STRONG>post&nbsp;rumors and early talks</STRONG> &nbsp;that are floating around , but puts&nbsp; the destiny of the musical&nbsp; once again into darkness. </P>
<P>Will Madonna take Guinan role or has she given up for another musical project?</P>
<P>As our readers remember <STRONG>DrownedMadonna exclusively</STRONG> revealed that <STRONG>Madonna rehearsed</STRONG> one of the songs from the musical for her <STRONG>RIT Tour.</STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG>The song is called " The Devil wouldn't recognize you" and it is written by Madonna and Mirwais Ahmadzai.</STRONG></P>
