	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P>Approaching her performance at <STRONG>Live8</STRONG>, <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> will start rehearsing in <STRONG>London</STRONG> with her band around <STRONG>24th June</STRONG>.</P>
